                        "review": "I like the game and the continuation of the story. I like the new elemens like the forensic kit, the phone, changes in gameplay and Paloma and Victoria.\n\nOnly i am stuck at the 'blackscreen on the stairs after the computer' problem. I tried everything i can find on the internet. Compatibility modes, different routes and it will just not work. And i dont want someone elses savegame. \n\nI am suprised some people finished this game at all. \n\nMaybe if there comes a mod of fix for this issue i will replay and recommend.",
